<p>Le jaaiye qaime me ye mashko alam moula<br />
Darya pa hue mere shaane bhi qalam moula</p>

<p>Hai waqt mera aaqir , jald aaiye ya sarwar<br />
taa dekhlu'n aankho'n se hazrat ke qadam moula</p>

<p>Ab waqt nahi aaqa, deedaar dikha deeje<br />
mushtaaqe ziyarat ka hai aankho'n me dam moula</p>

<p>Dikhlaayi nahi deta, ab aankh se qaadim ko<br />
hai aankh me paiwasta ek teere sitam moula</p>

<p>Rethi pa gira hu mai, narghe me ghira hu mai<br />
ruk ruk ke nikalta hai ab seene se dam moula</p>

<p>Kehta tha yahi rokar, saqqaye haram baqir,<br />
hai mashke sakina ka abbas ko gham moula<br />
</p>